Recommends: systemd-timesyncd
Description: control and monitoring panel for optical transfer equipment
 Amp Panel monitors Local/Remote optical stations and OBA/OBA3 amplifiers
 using a read-only status.xml interface. It
 stores measurements in SQLite, exposes a local web interface and SNMP
 endpoint, and integrates with RADIUS, syslog, NTP and NetworkManager.
